  <https://github.com/fractastical/delphisci/blob/00ba7c56fd6ffa0ae1e345c9a6a20e5298a9f814/claim-tests/math-bio-theorems/kimura-heterozygosity/result.json> dct:title "claim-tests/math-bio-theorems/kimura-heterozygosity/result.json at commit 00ba7c5 (2026-10-31T14:08:43Z)" ;
